msgid "当前证据与验收边界"
msgstr "Current evidence and acceptance boundaries"

#: ../../../../../docs/delivery/verification.md:3
msgid ""
"本页说明平台执行报告的范围与验收边界。每次迭代都按实际源码重新建立证据， 旧版本候选、历史测试数量和开发目录不继承为新 HEAD 的资格。实施台账的 "
"`implemented` 表示源码和工具已落地；验收状态以报告声明的受测代码身份为准。 "
"原始报告保留各自输出路径，绑定源码、配置、依赖、工具、命令返回码和产物。"
msgstr ""
"This page describes the scope and acceptance boundaries of platform "
"execution reports. Each iteration establishes evidence for its actual "
"source; old candidates, historical test counts and development directories "
"do not qualify a new HEAD. The ledger status `implemented` records source "
"and tool delivery; acceptance follows the tested code identity declared in "
"the report. Original reports retain their own output paths and bind source,"
" configuration, dependencies, tools, command exit codes and artifacts."

msgid "类型化平台统一：精确源码与执行边界"
msgstr "Typed platform unification: exact source and execution boundaries"

msgid ""
"本轮代码提交 P2 为 `fc01d863c3374643c276195ae19a24e6f8b8c8ee`，tree 为 "
"`e6f3d6310fd46265be49d47ef3fd7a4d944a8386`；对应 [平台 PR "
"38](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/38)。外部示例 E 为 "
"`acb5179ec09e0c2fae1911d32655296df39acedc`，tree 为 "
"`4e4e504c28766f0790dc4cd4dc45e8f9bcc49beb`；对应 [示例 PR "
"16](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/pull/16)。 PR "
"状态与软件执行是不同事实；本节不宣称上述 PR 已合并。"
msgstr ""
"The code source P2 is `fc01d863c3374643c276195ae19a24e6f8b8c8ee`, with "
"tree `e6f3d6310fd46265be49d47ef3fd7a4d944a8386`, in [platform PR "
"38](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/38). External examples E is "
"`acb5179ec09e0c2fae1911d32655296df39acedc`, with tree "
"`4e4e504c28766f0790dc4cd4dc45e8f9bcc49beb`, in [examples PR "
"16](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/pull/16). PR state and "
"software execution are separate facts; this section does not claim that "
"either PR has merged."

msgid ""
"候选 `typed-unification-fc01d863c337-acb5179ec09e` 已封存并经 owned verifier "
"实际校验通过，状态为 `software_qualified`，覆盖 `host_contracts`、`arm_link`、 "
"`resource_budget`、`source_sdk`、`reproducibility` 和 `hil_tooling` 六个原 "
"scope。 配置 SHA-256 为 "
"`0117c83ff7876bf3867338f31caec160c18815a629cb1c44bfe1a4ead410590b`； 候选 "
"JSON 为 2,366,210 bytes，SHA-256 为 "
"`f1c2af3ac73cb219b41b6d68f1c1b07db108357d0de8a92107ab7b1e8ec1ede6`。 同一 "
"ELF／BIN／map 的字节身份由原交付索引逐项记录。`hil_tooling` 只证明工装范围； 物理 HIL 仍为 "
"`not_executed`，签名为 `unsigned`，产品提升为 `not_performed`。"
msgstr ""
"Candidate `typed-unification-fc01d863c337-acb5179ec09e` was sealed and "
"actually passed its owned verifier. Its status is `software_qualified`, "
"covering the six original scopes `host_contracts`, `arm_link`, "
"`resource_budget`, `source_sdk`, `reproducibility` and `hil_tooling`. "
"Its configuration SHA-256 is "
"`0117c83ff7876bf3867338f31caec160c18815a629cb1c44bfe1a4ead410590b`. The "
"candidate JSON is 2,366,210 bytes, SHA-256 "
"`f1c2af3ac73cb219b41b6d68f1c1b07db108357d0de8a92107ab7b1e8ec1ede6`. The "
"original delivery index records the exact ELF/BIN/map byte identities. "
"`hil_tooling` establishes tooling scope only; physical HIL remains "
"`not_executed`, signature status is `unsigned`, and product promotion is"
" `not_performed`."

msgid ""
"R02 已完成两次独立 fresh、`--network none` 构建，共四条实际配置／构建命令， 均返回 0；两个独立输出的 "
"ELF／BIN 逐字节一致，原结果为 `bit_exact_elf_bin`。 所选配置是外部示例 "
"`reproduction/assemblies/qiming-baremetal.toml`：启明 F407ZG、 "
"裸机、`hse8-pll168`、`Os`、GPIO 输出和 UART1 IRQ events（容量 32），显式选择 `uart-owner`"
" 组件。该结果不扩展为其他板卡、模式或实板时序的复现结论。"
msgstr ""
"R02 completed two independent fresh builds with `--network none`: four "
"actual configure/build commands all returned 0. ELF/BIN bytes from the "
"two independent outputs are identical; the original result is "
"`bit_exact_elf_bin`. The selected input is the external example "
"`reproduction/assemblies/qiming-baremetal.toml`: Qiming F407ZG, "
"baremetal, `hse8-pll168`, `Os`, GPIO output and UART1 IRQ events with "
"capacity 32, explicitly selecting the `uart-owner` component. This "
"result does not extend to other boards, modes or physical timing."

msgid ""
