#: ../../../../../docs/delivery/verification.md:51
msgid ""
"此前 SoC 扩展迭代的 canonical commit、门禁与候选证据见 [SoC 扩展执行记录](soc-extensions-"
"verification.md)； [早期基线记录](soc-refinement-verification.md) 保留原版本证据。 "
"这些历史结果保持原源码范围，不构成本次重构的资格。 版本化 datasheet／manual／errata 索引只建立来源；实际 silicon "
"revision 和各 mode 的 workaround 适用性单独验收。 `soc_costs.py` 保存真实 ELF／反汇编／工具调用与可比 "
"profile，不将不同 backend、 route 或容量的大小差解释为同配置优化，也不把指令数量当作测得 cycles。"
msgstr ""
"Canonical commits, gates and candidate evidence from the earlier SoC "
"extension iteration are in the [SoC extension execution record](soc-"
"extensions-verification.md); the [earlier baseline record](soc-refinement-"
"verification.md) retains its original version's evidence. These historical "
"results keep their original source scope and do not qualify this refactor. "
"Versioned datasheet/manual/errata indexes establish provenance only; actual"
" silicon revisions and workaround applicability for each mode require "
"separate acceptance. `soc_costs.py` retains actual ELF/disassembly/tool "
"invocations and comparable profiles. It does not interpret size differences"
" across backends, routes or capacities as same-configuration optimization, "
"or instruction counts as measured cycles."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/verification.md:35
msgid ""
"`tools/hil/soc_acceptance.py` 对 SOC-37–55 提供十九项 plan/capture/validate "
"合同。plan 只产生 `prepared_unbound`；参考 G474/H743/U575 即使改名或重新计算 metadata "
"hash，也不能跳过 reference-only admission。真实 station 与工具输入、 协议、仪器、连续非空 samples 和 "
"reviewed limits 一起决定结果。物理 Flash 掉电还需外部产品提供擦除对齐且避开全部 firmware LOAD 的显式测试布局。"
msgstr ""
"`tools/hil/soc_acceptance.py` provides nineteen plan/capture/validate "
"contracts for SOC-37–55. Plan yields only `prepared_unbound`; reference "
"G474/H743/U575 cannot bypass reference-only admission through renaming or "
"recomputed metadata hashes. Actual station/tools, protocols, instruments, "
"continuous nonempty samples and reviewed limits determine results. Physical "
"Flash power cuts additionally require external erase-aligned test layouts "
"outside every firmware LOAD."

#: ../../../../../docs/delivery/verification.md:66
msgid ""
"此前开发执行目录 `build/controller-routes-factory/` 与 `build/minimal-factory-"
"resources/` 保留独立 attempt 和原始命令，不覆盖旧运行。资源 数字只描述对应 ELF；源码变化后重新执行。MSP "
"显式预留，heap=0；未使用的内存域 不因芯片具有该区域就自动驻留。汇编和 ELF 字节不能替代实际 cycles／IRQ latency。"
msgstr ""
"Earlier development execution directories `build/controller-routes-"
"factory/` and `build/minimal-factory-resources/` retain independent "
"attempts and original commands without overwriting old runs. Resource "
"numbers describe only the corresponding ELF; source changes require new "
"execution. MSP is explicitly reserved and heap=0; unused memory domains do "
"not become resident merely because a chip has them. Assembly and ELF bytes "
"do not substitute for actual cycles/IRQ latency."

#: ../../../../../docs/delivery/verification.md:71
msgid ""
"此前 CPU/runtime 开发执行目录为 `/workspace/nexus-all-cortex-evidence`，保存 CPU "
"事实/schema、原子 publication/RMW、九核寄存器模型、可选 feature 编译与 真实 kernel context "
"审计各自的原始报告。公开报告记录实际命令、退出码、工具 与 hash；通过数和 feature 范围由执行结果读取，不继承此前数字或一种组合。 "
"Source/installed Runtime consumer 与完整平台 consumer 分开建立证据，前者 没有具体 "
"startup、SoC、Board 或 factory，不能替代后者或 candidate 封存。"
msgstr ""
"The earlier CPU/runtime development execution directory is `/workspace"
"/nexus-all-cortex-evidence`. It retains original reports for CPU "
"facts/schema, atomic publication/RMW, nine-core register models, optional-"
"feature compilation and real kernel-context audits. Published reports "
"record actual commands, exit codes, tools and hashes; passing counts and "
"feature scope come from the execution results, without inheriting earlier "
"numbers or a different combination. Source/installed Runtime consumers and "
"full-platform consumers establish separate evidence: the former have no "
"concrete startup, SoC, Board or factory, and cannot replace the latter or "
"candidate sealing."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/verification.md:53
msgid ""
"RED 日志保存在 `tools/testing/evidence/`，GREEN 为真实框架执行。既有正确合同的 迁移明确标识，不为了制造 RED "
"而修改生产行为。commit hook 开始和结束检查暂存 快照及 index tree，拒绝执行期间发生的行为变更；失败不发布新的成功摘要。"
msgstr ""
"RED logs are in `tools/testing/evidence/`; GREEN is actual framework "
"execution. Migration of already-correct contracts is explicitly marked; "
"production behavior is not changed merely to manufacture RED. Commit hooks "
"check staged snapshots/index trees at start/end, reject behavior changes "
"during execution and publish no new success summary on failure."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/verification.md:57
msgid ""
"正式软件资格要求 clean source/dependency、准确工具环境与配置、非零 fresh tests、 同一 "
"ELF／BIN／map、当前预算、源码 SDK 独立消费与离线双构建。支持范围以 [精确支持矩阵](support.md) 为准，不把软件夹具的 "
"connector 继承到参考 Board。"
msgstr ""
"Formal software qualification requires clean source/dependencies, exact "
"tools/configuration, nonzero fresh tests, matching ELF/BIN/map, current "
"budgets, independent source-SDK consumption and offline double-build. [Exact"
" support scope](support.md) is authoritative; software-fixture connectors "
"are not inherited by reference Boards."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/verification.md:61
msgid ""
"所有物理时序、精度、波形、reset、掉电和长期负载项目尚未执行。FP/MVE context 切换、IRQ latency、cache/DMA "
"coherence、MPU/SAU 和安全世界协作也未进行实板 验收；可选 restricted MPU task 和 split runtime "
"的软件执行不能建立实板隔离 资格。实际 HIL 必须 记录 PCB、chip "
"UID、probe／serial／power、station、预算和同一候选 image。"
msgstr ""
"All physical timing, precision, waveform, reset, power-cut and sustained-"
"load items remain unexecuted. FP/MVE context switching, IRQ latency, "
"cache/DMA coherence, MPU/SAU and security-world cooperation also lack "
"physical acceptance. Optional restricted-MPU-task and split-runtime software"
" execution cannot establish physical isolation. Actual HIL must record PCB, "
"chip UID, probe/serial/power, station, budgets and the same candidate image."
